e box included on the outbound manifest for destruction. The notes indicate no return to the commissioning desk is possible, so the box follows the standard destruction path.\n\nThe policy explicitly states that failing to release the manifest by 13:30 leaves the shift incomplete. This means the entire batch cannot be withheld simply because one box lacks an approved extension. The only viable path is to follow the written procedure and include the box on the manifest for destruction today.",
